# Temperance — fix/481-publish-gate-off-sends-literal-string
- date: 2026-11-08
- scope-decision: One line in do_off, plus a test that pins the wire format
  rather than the control flow. Do NOT touch do_on — it works, and changing
  a working write to production config for symmetry is not worth the risk.
- blast-radius: the npm-publish environment on one repo. The script reads
  back and refuses to claim success, so a wrong write fails loudly.
- drift-trigger: if this turns into a rewrite of publish-gate.sh, stop.
